{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1Bpb25lZXIlMjAlMjgyMDEzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Pioneer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bpJyl76W6erraH08kf19nmpCwn3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2el9VEDz8R6NGlWRrsAwOpCQWMM.jpg","description":"Pioneer is set in the early '80s, at the beginning of the Norwegian Oil Boom. Enormous oil and gas deposits are discovered in the North Sea and the authorities aim to bring the oil ashore through a pipeline from depths of 500 meters. A professional diver, Petter, obsessed with reaching the bottom of the Norwegian Sea has the discipline, strength and courage to take on the world's most dangerous mission. But a sudden, tragic accident changes everything. Petter is sent on a perilous journey where he loses sight of who's pulling the strings. Gradually he realizes that he is in way over his head and that his life is at stake.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"106 min","cast":["Aksel Hennie","Wes Bentley","Stephen Lang","Stephanie Sigman","Jonathan LaPaglia","Ane Dahl Torp","Jørgen Langhelle","André Eriksen"],"director":["Erik Skjoldbjærg"],"released":"2013-08-30T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Aksel Hennie","character":"Petter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sceuNjVXtsHOS3cn0MsLfZRkAQx.jpg"},{"name":"Wes Bentley","character":"Mike","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/voD93lzFZrr9xfAggwFcPRBi84i.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Lang","character":"John Ferris","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gnO5VfkDgA2fsHweD0622LUY3Hu.jpg"},{"name":"Stephanie Sigman","character":"Maria Salatzar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7jSt9h30UV0S2GDZpzt8xNq2GVQ.jpg"},{"name":"Jonathan LaPaglia","character":"Ronald","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/75dsk5vK59ESagPhquplHNNkdmn.jpg"},{"name":"Ane Dahl Torp","character":"Pia","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/loW4MVWGzbJJzcBb